              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a7a018857ccab5e3b3d3d3031d96d02d5586cf7d504c3c0aea1251ca9f27370d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-product",
        "moduleId": "mod-timeline",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "产品成长期",
        "markdown": "进入产品成长期后，内存数据库开始大规模商业化。代表性产品如TimesTen、SQLite和SAP HANA等相继问世，覆盖了嵌入式设备、企业级数据平台和实时分析等多个市场。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
